{"unit_id":"toujianjian__dsh-do#card-zh","repo":"toujianjian/dsh-do","commit":"b6e490c9590c5ff5c50d067b08e0e7b0d01ae8b9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-DO 是面向 DSH Web 的自主工作流与界面扩展插件。它在 Host 注册循环驱动、模型工具和 /loop 命令，并在浏览器侧边栏加入 GitHub 项目与插件搜索、AI 安装入口、设置面板及添加工作区对话框。主要功能包括跨轮次目标循环与检查点恢复、重复工具调用检测和恢复、输出截断后续写、请求失败时按配置切换模型，以及可视化调整循环和重试参数。适合需要让 DSH 持续推进任务、发现插件或管理工作区的用户。GitHub 搜索使用公开 API；循环和模型切换参数可按部署配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:53-125","src/client/index.ts:33-69"]}
{"unit_id":"toujianjian__dsh-do#card-en","repo":"toujianjian/dsh-do","commit":"b6e490c9590c5ff5c50d067b08e0e7b0d01ae8b9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-DO adds autonomous loops and browser tools to DSH, including /loop, GitHub plugin search, AI installation, settings, and workspace controls. It supports checkpointed tasks, repeated-call recovery, output continuation, and model fallback. Useful for ongoing DSH tasks and plugin discovery.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:53-125","src/client/index.ts:33-69"]}
